  "descriptionHtml": "<div>Stainless steel case with a stainless steel mesh bracelet. Uni-directional rotating blue-plated stainless steel showing compass markings bezel. Blue dial with silver-tone skeleton hands and index hour markers. Minute markers. World time cities around the outer rim. Dial Type: Analog. Date display at the 4 o'clock position. Three sub-dials displaying:  24 hour, day/60 second/power reserve indicator and mode. Citizen caliber E660 eco-drive movement. Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. Solid case back. Round case shape. Case size: 46 mm. Case thickness: 12.9 mm. Band width: 22 mm. Deployment clasp with a push button release. Water resistant at 200 meters / 660 feet. Functions: perpetual calendar, atomic timekeeping, radio controlled, chronograph, world time, alarm, date, day, GMT, second time zone, hour, minute, second, power reserve indicator, solar-powered. Promaster Navihawk Series. Sport watch style. Watch label: Japan Movt. Citizen Promaster Navihawk Perpetual Alarm World Time Chronograph Blue Dial Men's Watch CB5848-57L.</div>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600;\">Technical Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <tbody>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Brand</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Citizen</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Series</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Promaster Navihawk</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Model</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">CB5848-57L</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e